<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
LinkForge (Blender) exports robot_description.urdf.xacro in raw CAD/Blender
scene units, not meters: every joint, visual and collision <origin xyz> and
<mesh scale> in that file is written as ${model_scale*...} against this property.

0.10604 (2026-10-05) is recalibrated against the physical robot: in the zero
pose the crown is 1.81 m above the floor, stand included. It replaced 0.1196,
carried over from the inmoov_urdf properties.xacro.

The inertials are in SI units for this scale: re-estimate them after changing
model_scale.
-->
<robot xmlns:xacro="http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro">

  <xacro:property name="model_scale" value="0.10604"/>

</robot>
